OL,5,G0400 Early Breakfast with Lucy Coward
OL,6,     FJoin Lucy for the ideal selection
OL,7,     Fof music if you rise first thing
OL,8,     Fin the morning.
OL,9,G0630 Dan Walker
OL,10,     FDan Walker has the perfect
OL,11,     Fclassical music to get you up in
OL,12,     Fthe morning, with all the news and
OL,13,     Ftravel updates you need to know
OL,14,     Ffor the day ahead, plus the Hall
OL,15,     Fof Fame Hour at 9am.
OL,16,G0900 The Classic FM Hall of Fame Hour
